<title>UK: Kommunalkredit sets 200 mln mark 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Kommunalkredit sets 200 mln mark 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bayer Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OESTERREICHISCHE KOMMUNALKREDIT AG VIENNA</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    02.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.96    PAY DATE    02.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  3.00	LISTING    MUN/FFURT PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/AT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    1.00	SELL CONC   1.50</p>
<p> LIST	 0.50</p>
<p> NOTES	UNWELTANLEIHE BOND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
